On its last pulse, your Tremor Engine shakes violently, raising a volcano for [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] turns.

Each turn, the volcano will send out fiery boulders that deal [60, 81, 98, 111, 124 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] fire and [60, 81, 98, 111, 124 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] physical damage.

Damage scales with your Steampower.

''All the fury of fire at your disposal!''
